Presence Footsteps Luanti Port - License Summary

This package is an unofficial Luanti port/reimplementation inspired by Presence
Footsteps. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or maintained by the original
Presence Footsteps authors.

New Luanti port code and port-owned documentation/metadata are distributed under
the GNU Lesser General Public License v3.0 or later:

  SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-3.0-or-later

This includes the Luanti Lua runtime code written for this port. The LGPL was
chosen as a weak copyleft license: the mod may be used in games, modpacks, and
servers, while modifications to the LGPL-covered port code should remain free.

Bundled upstream-origin media and converted upstream-origin data remain under
the upstream MIT License, with the upstream copyright notice preserved:

  

This includes the bundled `sounds/*.ogg` files and generated/converted mapping
data derived from the local Presence Footsteps source package used for this
project. See `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md` for source and attribution details.

AI disclosure: this port's code, documentation, and packaging work were
AI-assisted. No sound assets were generated by AI.

The original Java/Fabric implementation is not shipped as executable Luanti
code.

Full LGPL-3.0-or-later license text:
https://www.gnu.org/licenses/lgpl-3.0.html

